# Mayflies: Build-time "hack" to ignore live-build(7)'s generated sources.list
#           Avoids duplicate repository configuration (.source file) conflict

# Nullify APT's primary package configuration file: /etc/apt/sources.list
# APT fallback: '/etc/apt/sources.list.d/*.{list,sources}' (Dir::Etc::sourceparts)
Dir::Etc::sourcelist "/dev/null";
